Table: Change notification requirements

Columns: Notification timing | Requirements

Notification timing: beforehand | Label: Please tell us beforehand if | Requirements: {"conditions": ["You’re changing address.", "Your home will be unoccupied for longer than the ‘Days unoccupied limit’ shown on your Home Policy Schedule.", "You plan to rent out your home or use it as a holiday home.", "The number of lodgers or paying guests in your home changes (if a number is shown in your Home Policy Schedule).", "You plan to use your home for business reasons, or you’re making changes to the existing business reasons carried out at your home.", "You plan to do any renovation or building work inside or outside the property (except routine maintenance and decorating).", "The number of bedrooms or bathrooms in your home will change (if a number is shown in your Home Proposal Confirmation).", "The property will no longer be your home address."]}

Table: Change notification requirements

Columns: Notification timing | Requirements

Notification timing: immediately | Label: Please tell us immediately if | Requirements: {"conditions": ["You or anyone living with you is convicted of, has been charged with or waiting to hear about being charged for a criminal offence.", "The condition of your home worsens, and it increases the risk of loss or damage.", "The value of your contents, specified items, personal possessions or bicycles increases or any new specified items need to be added to your policy.", "The value of your high-risk items increases above the ‘Total high-risk items limit’ shown in your Home Policy Schedule.", "You need to add, remove or change your joint policyholder.", "You stop using your intruder alarm (if your Home Proposal Confirmation shows that you have one)."]}

Table: Change notification requirements

Columns: Notification timing | Requirements

Notification timing: when_you_renew | Label: Please tell us when you renew if | Requirements: {"conditions": ["Any of the details change in your Home Policy Schedule or Home Proposal Confirmation.", "You or anyone living with you are declared bankrupt, receive an IVA or enter into a trust deed. You only need to tell us if it’s asked on your Home Proposal Confirmation."], "good_to_know": ["IVA stands for Individual Voluntary Arrangement.", "In Scotland bankruptcy is known as sequestration.", "A trust deed is an agreement between you and the people you owe money to, to pay off debts from a credit agreement."]}
